{"actor": "opencode", "data": {"summary": "Conflict provenance read: commit fd7b4a1 committed three unresolved conflict regions. FAILURES.md and FAILURES-findings-2.md have HEAD=sync-land F011 vs theirs=empty, because the renumber deleted an F011 that had since become the other VM's finding; DECISIONS-GATING.md has HEAD='the experiment README' vs theirs='README' with a duplicated >>>>>>> trailer. Correct resolution keeps both sides in all three."}, "host": "instance-20260717-0944", "kind": "note", "schema": "origin.session.event/1", "seq": 2, "session": "2026-10-03-037-repair-the-three-mission-records-corrupt", "ts": "2026-10-03T22:44:06+00:00"}
{"actor": "opencode", "data": {"argv": ["bash", "-c", "for f in FAILURES.md FAILURES-findings-2.md DECISIONS-GATING.md; do git show fd7b4a1:$f > /tmp/opencode/pre-$f; done; PYTHONPATH=tools python3 -c \"\nimport pathlib, sys\nfrom originlib import conflicts\nbase = pathlib.Path(\\\"/tmp/opencode\\\")\nbad = 0\nfor path in sorted(base.glob(\\\"pre-*.md\\\")):\n    found, _ = conflicts.scan_file(path)\n    for item in found:\n        bad += 1\n        print(f\\\"{path.name}:{item.line}: {item.detail}\\\")\nprint(f\\\"findings on the pre-fix tree: {bad}\\\")\nsys.exit(0 if bad else 1)\n\""], "cwd": "/home/ubuntu/think-free", "duration_ms": 179, "exit_code": 0, "log": "sessions/2026-10-03-037-repair-the-three-mission-records-corrupt/commands.log", "log_line_end": 8, "log_line_start": 1, "redactions": [], "summary": "$ bash -c for f in FAILURES.md FAILURES-findings-2.md DECISIONS-GATING.md; do git show fd7b4a1:$f > /tmp/opencode/pre-$f; done; PYTHONPATH=too"}, "duration_ms": 179, "exit_code": 0, "host": "instance-20260717-0944", "kind": "command", "schema": "origin.session.event/1", "seq": 3, "session": "2026-10-03-037-repair-the-three-mission-records-corrupt", "ts": "2026-10-03T22:46:25+00:00"}
